// DAILY VISITS - CORRECTION 2 (UNVERIFIED proposal, not the real rules):
// submitOrderWithVisit now also READS orders/o_<uid>_<requestId> inside the transaction (it does
// not exist on a first save; on a retry it is compared with the incoming details). The rep must be
// allowed `get` on that path when it does not exist (resource == null) and when createdBy == uid.
// Check this against the real rules; if `get` on a missing order is denied the whole transaction fails.
